  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116394",
      "title": "Registering Multiple Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 270,
      "videoOrder": 258,
      "sourceHash": "60d923c8e10b3d4770d91ff6fd2a31814d3291858b282282f6779787c35aa8ba",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "So let's add a second route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 6.06,
          "en": "to this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.06,
          "end": 7.62,
          "en": "And I wanna add a route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.62,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "that should be active right from the start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 14.16,
          "en": "if we visit just local host 4200",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.16,
          "end": 16.473,
          "en": "without any path thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "Of course we can see all this content in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.42,
          "en": "but that's only the case because this content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.42,
          "end": 27.09,
          "en": "is part of the app component template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.09,
          "end": 30.09,
          "en": "I'm outputting the header and the user's component there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.09,
          "end": 31.71,
          "en": "And as I explained before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 34.41,
          "en": "this component is rendered initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "That's the main component of our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "And routing then kind of takes place inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 43.59,
          "en": "with help of the router outlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.59,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "But that's why this area is pretty empty initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "because we don't have any route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "for that no-path case here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 55.68,
          "en": "And that's exactly what I wanna change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.68,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "Now, I do already have a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 62.55,
          "en": "which I wanna show in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 67.267,
          "en": "because I do have a no-task component, which simply says,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.267,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "\"Select a user to see their tasks.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "And it's this no-task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 77.40299999999999,
          "en": "that should be loaded if we visit an empty path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.84,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll add another route object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 85.41,
          "en": "And the order doesn't matter too much here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.41,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "if we're dealing with different paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 92.34,
          "en": "If we would have similar paths, then the order would matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.34,
          "end": 96.36,
          "en": "because the routes are resolved from top to bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "But I still personally like to order my routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 104.78999999999999,
          "en": "such that they become more complex from top to bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.78999999999999,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "So the simple routes at the top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 108.90299999999999,
          "en": "and then the more complex nested ones down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.94,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "And I wanna add a new route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 117.35,
          "en": "which has an empty path for your domain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 121.08,
          "en": "like local host 4200 slash nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 123.54,
          "en": "or even no slash at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.54,
          "end": 127.29,
          "en": "That's what this path here will represent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.29,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "And as a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 133.17,
          "en": "I wanna load this no-task component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.17,
          "end": 136.173,
          "en": "which is imported from the appropriate folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.18,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "And that's then all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "We already have the router outlet in place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 146.7,
          "en": "so we don't need to do anything regarding that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.7,
          "end": 149.52,
          "en": "And therefore here, if I go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.52,
          "end": 152.52,
          "en": "I see that \"select a user text\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.52,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "from that no-task component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 157.563,
          "en": "if I haven't selected a user yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.21,
          "end": 164.21,
          "en": "And if I visit /tasks, that changes to this fallback text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 170.583,
          "en": "And that proves that this basic routing is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "As a next step, it would of course be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "if we wouldn't have to change the URL manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 180.72,
          "en": "because no one does that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.72,
          "end": 184.2,
          "en": "Instead, it would be nice if we could click these users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 184.2,
          "end": 187.29,
          "en": "so if we had links we could interact with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.29,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "that would lead to these different routes being loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.47,
          "end": 192.993,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we'll take care of next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
